{"4198430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Camp : Dawn", "steam_appid": 4198430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4368960, 4368970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Camp is a post-apocalyptic world-themed game. It utilizes high-quality graphics, a rich weapon and item system, and a vast world map to create a cross-generational twin-stick shooter, bringing a feast to hardcore shooter players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has become a wasteland, and humanity has established its last camp on the ruins. Everyone must coexist with the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camp will encounter various problems, such as a lack of oil, inability to generate electricity, and the need for clean water. Players must solve these crises as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players must use the technology and weapons left behind by humanity to fight against various mutated zombies, evil raiders, and giant mechanical monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 8 chapters and endless side challenge levels, with a total playtime of over 15 hours. A full pathfinding system is included throughout the main storyline, ensuring you'll never get lost on the game map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can play solo or online in co-op (up to 4 players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial release includes two free DLC items: the Explorer Weapon Pack and the Conqueror Kit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Camp is a post-apocalyptic world-themed game. It utilizes high-quality graphics, a rich weapon and item system, and a vast world map to create a cross-generational twin-stick shooter, bringing a feast to hardcore shooter players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has become a wasteland, and humanity has established its last camp on the ruins. Everyone must coexist with the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camp will encounter various problems, such as a lack of oil, inability to generate electricity, and the need for clean water. Players must solve these crises as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players must use the technology and weapons left behind by humanity to fight against various mutated zombies, evil raiders, and giant mechanical monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay